# Caddy in front of the token server: TLS from Let's Encrypt (the browser microphone needs
# HTTPS), WebSockets and everything else proxied to Anole on the loopback. Anole trusts the
# loopback (ANOLE_PROXY_TRUSTED), so rate limits see each client's X-Forwarded-For.
{$VORP_DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
}
